IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BXOUTB.

*> Durable outbound intent (GATE 3, outbox pattern).  Answers: what should
*> be sent, why, which internal operation created it, which external
*> identity it uses, whether it was sent, what response was received and
*> whether the outcome is known.  Retries reuse the same external identity.
*> This store is an operational record of EXTERNAL attempts only; it never
*> posts to the GL and never becomes authoritative for financial truth.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT OB-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-OB-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS OB-OPID OF OB-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-OB-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD OB-FILE.
01 OB-REC.
   05 OB-OPID          PIC X(16).
   05 OB-OPKIND        PIC X(12).
   05 OB-OP            PIC X(14).
   05 OB-CHANNEL       PIC X(12).
   05 OB-E2E           PIC X(32).
   05 OB-MSGID         PIC X(32).
   05 OB-AMT           PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 OB-CUR           PIC X(03).
   05 OB-INTERNAL      PIC X(32).
   05 OB-STATE         PIC X(16).
   05 OB-RETRIES       PIC 9(03).
   05 OB-CERTID        PIC X(24).
   05 OB-SIG           PIC X(64).
   05 OB-SIM           PIC X(12).
   05 OB-OUTCOME       PIC X(12).
   05 OB-EXTREF        PIC X(32).
   05 OB-FP            PIC X(16).
   05 OB-ENV           PIC X(16).
   05 OB-REASON        PIC X(60).
   05 OB-OPER          PIC X(12).
   05 OB-CORR          PIC X(24).
   05 OB-CREATED       PIC 9(14).
   05 OB-SENT          PIC 9(14).
   05 OB-RESP          PIC 9(14).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-OB-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-OB-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-SEAM PIC X(24).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-FP-BUF PIC X(400).
01 WS-FP-LEN PIC 9(04).
01 WS-FP PIC X(16).
01 WS-AGE-CUTOFF PIC 9(14).
01 WS-CANON PIC X(200).
01 WS-CNT PIC 9(04).
01 WS-SAVE-OP PIC X(14).
01 WS-SAVE-OPER PIC X(12).
01 WS-SAVE-CORR PIC X(24).
01 WS-SAVE-REASON PIC X(60).
01 WS-BND-PAYLOAD PIC X(2000).
01 WS-BND-SIG PIC X(64).
01 WS-EVT-TYPE PIC X(40).
01 WS-EVT-PL PIC X(200).
COPY "BPXCFG".
COPY "BKCFTP".
COPY "BKAUDP".
COPY "BKEVTP".
01 WS-E2E-S PIC X(32).
01 WS-STATE-S PIC X(16).
01 WS-RETRY-S PIC 9(03).
01 WS-OUTCOME-S PIC X(12).
01 WS-EXTREF-S PIC X(32).
01 WS-FP-S PIC X(16).
01 WS-CERT-S PIC X(24).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BKBNDP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-BND-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO BD-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO BD-MSG
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    CALL "BPXCFG" USING BK-PX-CFG
    IF PC-ADAPTER NOT = "FIXTURE"
        MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "BOUNDARY ADAPTER NOT CONFIGURED" TO BD-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE PC-ENVIRONMENT TO BD-ENV
    ACCEPT WS-SEAM FROM ENVIRONMENT "KOF_BND_SEAM"
    MOVE BD-OP TO WS-SAVE-OP
    MOVE BD-OPERATOR TO WS-SAVE-OPER
    MOVE BD-CORR TO WS-SAVE-CORR
    MOVE BD-REASON TO WS-SAVE-REASON
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-OB-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/bndout.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-OB-PATH
    PERFORM OPEN-STORE
    IF BD-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(BD-OP)
        WHEN "ADD" PERFORM DO-ADD
        WHEN "PROCESS" PERFORM DO-PROCESS
        WHEN "QUERY" PERFORM DO-QUERY
        WHEN "CORRELATE" PERFORM DO-CORRELATE
        WHEN "REAP" PERFORM DO-REAP
        WHEN "GET" PERFORM DO-GET
        WHEN "LIST" PERFORM DO-LIST
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN OUTBOX OP" TO BD-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE OB-FILE
    GOBACK.

OPEN-STORE.
    OPEN I-O OB-FILE
    IF WS-OB-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT OB-FILE
        CLOSE OB-FILE
        OPEN I-O OB-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-OB-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-OB-ST TO BD-RC
        MOVE "CANNOT OPEN OUTBOUND INTENT STORE" TO BD-MSG
    END-IF.

READ-INTENT.
    MOVE BD-OP-ID TO OB-OPID OF OB-REC
    READ OB-FILE
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "23" TO BD-RC
            MOVE "OUTBOUND INTENT NOT FOUND" TO BD-MSG
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-READ
    MOVE "00" TO BD-RC.

EXPOSE-INTENT.
    MOVE OB-STATE OF OB-REC TO WS-STATE-S
    MOVE OB-RETRIES OF OB-REC TO WS-RETRY-S
    MOVE OB-OUTCOME OF OB-REC TO WS-OUTCOME-S
    MOVE OB-EXTREF OF OB-REC TO WS-EXTREF-S
    MOVE OB-FP OF OB-REC TO WS-FP-S
    MOVE OB-CERTID OF OB-REC TO WS-CERT-S
    MOVE OB-E2E OF OB-REC TO WS-E2E-S.

DO-ADD.
    IF BD-OP-ID = SPACES OR BD-E2E-ID = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "OP ID AND EXTERNAL IDENTITY REQUIRED" TO BD-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE BD-OP-ID TO OB-OPID OF OB-REC
    READ OB-FILE
        INVALID KEY CONTINUE
        NOT INVALID KEY
            MOVE "22" TO BD-RC
            MOVE "OUTBOUND INTENT ALREADY EXISTS" TO BD-MSG
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-READ
    PERFORM BUILD-FP
    MOVE WS-FP TO BD-FP
    MOVE WS-FP TO OB-FP OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-OP-KIND TO OB-OPKIND OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-FAMILY TO OB-OP OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-CHANNEL TO OB-CHANNEL OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-E2E-ID TO OB-E2E OF OB-REC
    IF BD-MSG-ID = SPACES
        MOVE BD-E2E-ID TO OB-MSGID OF OB-REC
    ELSE
        MOVE BD-MSG-ID TO OB-MSGID OF OB-REC
    END-IF
    MOVE BD-AMOUNT TO OB-AMT OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-CURRENCY TO OB-CUR OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-INTERNAL TO OB-INTERNAL OF OB-REC
    MOVE "PENDING" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
    MOVE 0 TO OB-RETRIES OF OB-REC
    IF BD-CERT-ID = SPACES AND PC-CERT-REF NOT = SPACES
        MOVE PC-CERT-REF TO OB-CERTID OF OB-REC
    ELSE
        MOVE BD-CERT-ID TO OB-CERTID OF OB-REC
    END-IF
    MOVE BD-SIM TO OB-SIM OF OB-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO OB-SIG OF OB-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO OB-OUTCOME OF OB-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO OB-EXTREF OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-ENV TO OB-ENV OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-REASON TO OB-REASON OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-OPERATOR TO OB-OPER OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-CORR TO OB-CORR OF OB-REC
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO OB-CREATED OF OB-REC
    MOVE 0 TO OB-SENT OF OB-REC
    MOVE 0 TO OB-RESP OF OB-REC
    WRITE OB-REC
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
            MOVE "OUTBOUND INTENT WRITE FAILED" TO BD-MSG
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-WRITE
    PERFORM AUDIT-STATE
    MOVE "OUTBOUND INTENT RECORDED" TO BD-MSG.

BUILD-FP.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-FP-BUF
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(BD-CHANNEL) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(BD-OP-KIND)
        DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(BD-FAMILY) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(BD-E2E-ID) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        BD-AMOUNT DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(BD-CURRENCY) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(BD-INTERNAL) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-FP-BUF
    END-STRING
    MOVE 400 TO WS-FP-LEN
    CALL "BHSH" USING WS-FP-BUF WS-FP-LEN WS-FP.

DO-PROCESS.
    PERFORM READ-INTENT
    IF BD-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "ACKED" OR
       OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "REJECTED"
        PERFORM EXPOSE-INTENT
        PERFORM WRITE-BACK
        MOVE "00" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "OUTBOUND INTENT ALREADY FINAL" TO BD-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "RESP_HELD"
        MOVE OB-STATE OF OB-REC TO BD-STATE
        MOVE "24" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "RESPONSE HELD PERSIST QUERY TO RESOLVE" TO BD-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF OB-CERTID OF OB-REC NOT = SPACES
        PERFORM ENSURE-SIGNED
        IF BD-RC NOT = "00"
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
    END-IF
    IF WS-SEAM = "CRASH_BEFORE_SEND"
        MOVE "90" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "SIMULATED CRASH BEFORE EXTERNAL SEND" TO BD-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM SEND-TRANSPORT.

ENSURE-SIGNED.
    IF OB-SIG OF OB-REC NOT = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CANON
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(OB-MSGID OF OB-REC) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(OB-E2E OF OB-REC)
        DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE OB-AMT OF OB-REC
        DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(OB-CUR OF OB-REC) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-CANON
    END-STRING
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-CRT-PARMS
    MOVE "SIGN" TO CT-OP
    MOVE OB-CERTID OF OB-REC TO CT-ID
    MOVE WS-CANON TO WS-BND-PAYLOAD
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BND-SIG
    CALL "BSEC" USING BK-CRT-PARMS WS-BND-PAYLOAD WS-BND-SIG
    IF CT-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE CT-RC TO BD-RC
        MOVE CT-MSG TO BD-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-BND-SIG TO OB-SIG OF OB-REC
    REWRITE OB-REC.

SEND-TRANSPORT.
    MOVE SPACES TO BD-STATE BD-OUTCOME BD-EXT-REF BD-FP
        BD-CERT-ID
    MOVE "SEND" TO BD-OP
    MOVE OB-CHANNEL OF OB-REC TO BD-CHANNEL
    MOVE "FIXTURE" TO BD-ADAPTER
    MOVE OB-OP OF OB-REC TO BD-FAMILY
    IF OB-OPKIND OF OB-REC = "STL"
        MOVE "STL" TO BD-OP-KIND
    ELSE
        MOVE "PAY" TO BD-CLASS
    END-IF
    MOVE OB-MSGID OF OB-REC TO BD-MSG-ID
    MOVE OB-E2E OF OB-REC TO BD-E2E-ID
    MOVE OB-AMT OF OB-REC TO BD-AMOUNT
    MOVE OB-CUR OF OB-REC TO BD-CURRENCY
    MOVE OB-SIM OF OB-REC TO BD-SIM
    CALL "BXTP" USING BK-BND-PARMS
    IF BD-RC = "90"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    ADD 1 TO OB-RETRIES OF OB-REC
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO OB-SENT OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-OUTCOME TO OB-OUTCOME OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-EXT-REF TO OB-EXTREF OF OB-REC
    IF WS-SEAM = "CRASH_AFTER_SEND"
        MOVE "SENT" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
        REWRITE OB-REC
        MOVE "SENT" TO BD-STATE
        MOVE WS-OUTCOME-S TO WS-OUTCOME-S
        MOVE "90" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "SIMULATED CRASH AFTER SEND RESPONSE UNPERSISTED"
            TO BD-MSG
        PERFORM AUDIT-STATE
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF BD-CLASS = "OK"
        MOVE "ACKED" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
    ELSE
        IF BD-CLASS = "RJCT"
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
        ELSE
            IF BD-CLASS = "TPERR"
                MOVE "PENDING" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
            ELSE
                MOVE "UNKNOWN" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF
    IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "ACKED" OR
       OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "REJECTED"
        MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO OB-RESP OF OB-REC
    END-IF
    REWRITE OB-REC
    PERFORM EXPOSE-INTENT
    PERFORM AUDIT-STATE
    PERFORM WRITE-BACK
    IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "ACKED"
        MOVE "00" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "OUTBOUND ACKNOWLEDGED" TO BD-MSG
    ELSE
        IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "REJECTED"
            MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
            MOVE "OUTBOUND REJECTED BY EXTERNAL" TO BD-MSG
        ELSE
            IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "PENDING"
                MOVE "09" TO BD-RC
                MOVE "TRANSPORT FAILURE RETRY LATER" TO BD-MSG
            ELSE
                MOVE "24" TO BD-RC
                MOVE "EXTERNAL OUTCOME UNKNOWN CORRELATE"
                    TO BD-MSG
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.

DO-QUERY.
    PERFORM READ-INTENT
    IF BD-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "ACKED" OR
       OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "REJECTED"
        PERFORM EXPOSE-INTENT
        PERFORM WRITE-BACK
        MOVE "00" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "OUTBOUND INTENT ALREADY FINAL" TO BD-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO BD-STATE BD-OUTCOME BD-EXT-REF BD-FP
        BD-CERT-ID
    MOVE "QUERY" TO BD-OP
    MOVE OB-CHANNEL OF OB-REC TO BD-CHANNEL
    MOVE "FIXTURE" TO BD-ADAPTER
    MOVE OB-MSGID OF OB-REC TO BD-MSG-ID
    MOVE OB-E2E OF OB-REC TO BD-E2E-ID
    MOVE OB-EXTREF OF OB-REC TO BD-EXT-REF
    CALL "BXTP" USING BK-BND-PARMS
    MOVE BD-OUTCOME TO OB-OUTCOME OF OB-REC
    IF BD-EXT-REF NOT = SPACES
        MOVE BD-EXT-REF TO OB-EXTREF OF OB-REC
    END-IF
    ADD 1 TO OB-RETRIES OF OB-REC
    IF BD-CLASS = "OK"
        MOVE "ACKED" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
        MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO OB-RESP OF OB-REC
    ELSE
        IF BD-CLASS = "RJCT"
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
            MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO OB-RESP OF OB-REC
        ELSE
            MOVE "UNKNOWN" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
        END-IF
    END-IF
    REWRITE OB-REC
    PERFORM EXPOSE-INTENT
    PERFORM AUDIT-STATE
    PERFORM WRITE-BACK
    IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "ACKED"
        MOVE "00" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "EXTERNAL OUTCOME RESOLVED" TO BD-MSG
    ELSE
        IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC = "REJECTED"
            MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
            MOVE "EXTERNAL OUTCOME REJECTED" TO BD-MSG
        ELSE
            MOVE "24" TO BD-RC
            MOVE "EXTERNAL OUTCOME STILL UNKNOWN" TO BD-MSG
        END-IF
    END-IF.

DO-CORRELATE.
    PERFORM READ-INTENT
    IF BD-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF BD-RESULT NOT = "ACKED" AND BD-RESULT NOT = "REJECTED"
        MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "CORRELATION REQUIRES EXPLICIT RESULT" TO BD-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF BD-REASON = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "CORRELATION REQUIRES REASON" TO BD-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE BD-RESULT TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-RESULT TO OB-OUTCOME OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-REASON TO OB-REASON OF OB-REC
    MOVE BD-OPERATOR TO OB-OPER OF OB-REC
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO OB-RESP OF OB-REC
    REWRITE OB-REC
    PERFORM EXPOSE-INTENT
    PERFORM AUDIT-STATE
    PERFORM WRITE-BACK
    MOVE "00" TO BD-RC
    MOVE "OUTBOUND CORRELATED BY OPERATOR" TO BD-MSG.

DO-REAP.
    IF BD-AGE-SECS = 0
        MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "REAP REQUIRES AGE SECONDS" TO BD-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-AGE-CUTOFF =
        FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-NOW(1:14)) - BD-AGE-SECS
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CNT
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ OB-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM REAP-ONE
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-CNT TO BD-CNT
    MOVE "00" TO BD-RC
    STRING "OUTBOUND REAPED " DELIMITED SIZE WS-CNT
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO BD-MSG
    END-STRING.

REAP-ONE.
    IF OB-STATE OF OB-REC NOT = "PENDING" AND
       OB-STATE OF OB-REC NOT = "SENT" AND
       OB-STATE OF OB-REC NOT = "RESP_HELD"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF OB-CREATED OF OB-REC > WS-AGE-CUTOFF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE "UNKNOWN" TO OB-STATE OF OB-REC
    MOVE "STALE UNRESOLVED OUTBOUND INTENT" TO OB-REASON
    REWRITE OB-REC
    ADD 1 TO WS-CNT
    PERFORM AUDIT-STATE.

DO-GET.
    PERFORM READ-INTENT
    IF BD-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPOSE-INTENT
    PERFORM WRITE-BACK
    MOVE OB-REASON OF OB-REC TO BD-REASON
    MOVE "00" TO BD-RC.

DO-LIST.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CNT
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ OB-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END
                ADD 1 TO WS-CNT
                DISPLAY "opid=" FUNCTION TRIM(OB-OPID OF OB-REC)
                    " state=" FUNCTION TRIM(OB-STATE OF OB-REC)
                    " e2e=" FUNCTION TRIM(OB-E2E OF OB-REC)
                    " outcome="
                    FUNCTION TRIM(OB-OUTCOME OF OB-REC)
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-CNT TO BD-CNT.

WRITE-BACK.
    MOVE WS-STATE-S TO BD-STATE
    MOVE WS-RETRY-S TO BD-RETRY
    MOVE WS-OUTCOME-S TO BD-OUTCOME
    MOVE WS-EXTREF-S TO BD-EXT-REF
    MOVE WS-FP-S TO BD-FP
    MOVE WS-CERT-S TO BD-CERT-ID.

AUDIT-STATE.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE WS-SAVE-OPER TO BK-AUD-OPERATOR
    IF OB-OPER OF OB-REC NOT = SPACES
        MOVE OB-OPER OF OB-REC TO BK-AUD-OPERATOR
    END-IF
    STRING "BND-" DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SAVE-OP)
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO BK-AUD-ACTION
    END-STRING
    MOVE OB-OPID OF OB-REC TO BK-AUD-ENTITY
    MOVE OB-CORR OF OB-REC TO BK-AUD-CORR
    MOVE OB-STATE OF OB-REC TO BK-AUD-AFTER
    MOVE BD-RC TO BK-AUD-RESULT
    CALL "BAUD" USING BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-EVT-PARMS
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-EVT-TYPE
    STRING "BOUNDARY.OUTBOUND." DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(OB-STATE OF OB-REC) DELIMITED SIZE ".v1"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-EVT-TYPE
    END-STRING
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-EVT-PL
    MOVE OB-AMT OF OB-REC TO WS-FP-LEN
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(OB-OPID OF OB-REC) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(OB-E2E OF OB-REC)
        DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(OB-CHANNEL OF OB-REC) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(OB-ENV OF OB-REC)
        DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE OB-RETRIES OF OB-REC
        DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(OB-OUTCOME OF OB-REC) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-EVT-PL
    END-STRING
    MOVE OB-OPID OF OB-REC TO BK-EVT-KEY
    MOVE WS-EVT-TYPE TO BK-EVT-TYPE
    MOVE WS-EVT-PL TO BK-EVT-PAYLOAD
    CALL "BEVT" USING BK-EVT-PARMS.
